WEBVTT

00:10:56.955 --> 00:11:00.131
mais aussi à l'aide de la source d'énergie

00:11:00.131 --> 00:11:03.115
du site du Qatar

00:11:03.115 --> 00:11:03.969
qui est le soleil.

00:11:03.969 --> 00:11:06.485
(Applaudissements)

00:11:06.485 --> 00:11:08.010
Merci beaucoup. (Applaudissements)

00:11:08.010 --> 00:11:10.714
Shukran. (Applaudissements)